WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.160
Jeanne, you're amazing!
You're practically Lady Luck!

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:19.000
A little bit.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.460
This is no little bit! You've already
won 3000 livres, at least!

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.840
Stop sounding so stingy.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.420
This is nothing when it comes to my real luck.

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:41.560
Oh, there you are, Jeanne.
How are things goin—

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:41.560
Shh!

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.760
Black 26!

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:47.160
Yes! 37 to 1 !

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:48.590
370 livres!

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:50.600
Look at you, Jeanne!

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:51.530
How lucky!

00:00:51.530 --> 00:00:54.030
My, Cardinal Rohan...

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:57.110
I didn't realize you were standing there.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:58.400
It's all right.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.470
What brings you here?

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:03.210
Is there something that's troubling you?

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.010
No... Nothing particularly troubling...

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:09.340
But there is something, isn't there?

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:13.640
Cardinal, I'm always here to help
if you should need anything.

00:01:19.830 --> 00:01:22.060
Let it all ride on Black 26!

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:23.530
Come on!

