00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.950
episode

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.950
"The Black Rose

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.950
Blooms at Night"

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.920
Well, about what's his face, that lady-killer...

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.190
That Swede named Fersen...

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:11.120
He's, well, no longer at Versailles, right?

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:15.200
Yes, I hear he volunteered for the
Expeditionary Force to America.

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:16.830
Yes, exactly.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:20.540
Which means, well...
Her Majesty is lonely right now.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:22.770
Which also means, my greatest
opportunity has come!

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.410
Or so I thought.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.050
I see...

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:26.840
So yes...

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:30.150
Like always, I went to Versailles,
thinking today would be the day,

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:32.750
and requested an audience with Her Majesty.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:34.720
But you were flat out denied.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:35.380
Yes!

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.750
Not only that, it's getting worse every time.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:42.090
Today, they made me wait 3 hours until they
finally said, ''Please come back next time.''

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:42.950
See what I mean?

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:50.670
I, Rohan, possess glory, rank and fortune.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:53.670
All the pleasures of this world are mine to enjoy.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.920
However, it's all rubbish
compared to Her Majesty.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.910
What I truly yearn for is
beauty and dignity that's pure.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.680
Lady Marie Antoinette,
destined to be Queen from birth!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:12.420
Oh, if I could just touch upon your dignity,
I would give everything up without regret.

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.720
Oh, Lady Marie Antoinette...!

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:36.080
Lady Oscar, tea is ready.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:38.070
Thank you, Rosalie.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:04:59.610
<i>Oscar, I'm going to run away.</i>

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.230
<i>I'm sorry, but I must!</i>

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.610
<i>To a far off place thousands of miles away!</i>

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:10.000
Oscar, let's go for a ride.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:29.690
That's it, Oscar!

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:30.660
Keep it up!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:00.860
<i>Sister...!</i>

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:01.920
<i>Jeanne!</i>

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:06.220
Colonel Oscar François de Jarjayes.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:12.660
I heard you were vacationing on these shores,
so I came to visit you from Versailles.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.140
My name is Jeanne Valois.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:22.770
If I recall correctly, I've seen you once at
Marquise Boulainvilliers' funeral.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.320
Why I see. I'm honored then.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.990
You said you came all the way from Versailles?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.740
What is it that you want from me?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:33.060
I've come to give you my greetings.

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:38.670
My husband, Nicolas, joined the Royal
Guards Regiment about a month ago.

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:44.300
Please look after him well.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.710
You came all this way from Versailles
just to tell me that?

00:06:49.710 --> 00:06:52.300
No, I'd never be so rude.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:00.520
Please accept it.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.620
What is the meaning of this?!

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.130
Meaning?

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.430
There's no meaning at all.

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.080
It's simply common courtesy.

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.080
There's my common courtesy!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:27.130
It's best you remember that!

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.920
How respectable of you.

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:33.390
There are many people like yourself,

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:37.280
but people like you are the type
I find least interesting.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:47.130
Rosalie, let's go.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:48.200
Yes.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.590
André, where's Rosalie?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:12.550
Huh?

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:16.760
Oh, we must have went too fast.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.520
It's all right. She'll catch up soon enough.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:23.260
It's been a while.

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.060
Yes, it has...

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:29.310
So the rumors about you being taken
in by the Jarjayes family were true.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.480
Seems you're doing quite well.

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:33.880
Don't say it as though I had planned it!

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.990
More importantly, Jeanne, what
did you want from Lady Oscar?

00:08:37.720 --> 00:08:40.750
Actually, I'm doing pretty well myself.

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.040
Jeanne!

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.790
I'm me.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.160
You're you.

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:47.260
What we do is our own business.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:48.670
Let's stay out of each other's way.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:58.700
Looking back at our miserable
lives plagued with hunger,

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.520
God is sure to forgive us no matter what we do.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:04.980
See you, Rosalie.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:14.370
Our plan was a success!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.370
What?!

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:20.330
You mean that strait-laced, prim-faced
Oscar François took the bribe?!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.030
Of course, she did.

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:24.790
There isn't a soul in this world
that doesn't like gold coins.

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:28.600
Fill the moat to take down a castle, they say.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:32.600
The one the Queen trusts most, Oscar François,
Regiment Commander of the Royal Guards,

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:33.870
is the first we draw in.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.800
A brilliant idea, don't you think, Cardinal Rohan?

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:38.110
Yes, indeed!

00:09:38.110 --> 00:09:40.240
There was the expense of the bribe, but still...

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.850
So? What do we do next?

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:44.980
Please prepare 10,000 livres.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:45.770
10,000?!

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:48.290
This is where our plan gets serious.

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.440
We'll ask Oscar to arrange
an audience with the Queen.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.760
Why didn't you say so?!
I can see the Queen already?!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.230
Oh, you mustn't rush things.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:09:59.460
I'll meet the Queen first.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:01.000
Ah, yes. That's right.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.300
Once I become close with the Queen,

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.790
I'll introduce you, so nothing seems out of place.

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.080
It takes time and money to
make one's love come true.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.650
Understand?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.260
I know, I know. I'm counting on you, Jeanne.

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:29.310
Wait, you mean the Regiment
Commander didn't accept it?

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:32.520
I blew it. I picked the wrong person.

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.370
What are we doing with this money then?

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.800
Send it back to Rohan?

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.270
Don't be stupid!

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:39.740
Of course we're keeping the money.
What do you think?

00:10:40.370 --> 00:10:41.530
I see.

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:46.160
Still, if we can't use Oscar François
to get acquainted with the Queen...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.850
It'll be fine.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.840
I'll handle Rohan.

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:53.890
You keep an eye on that
female Regiment Commander.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:55.950
That woman rubs me the wrong way.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:59.120
It'll be fine if our plan plays out well, but...

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.100
...there's always that slim chance
something might go awry.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.990
Come on, step in!

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.060
Watch your opponent's sword!
Come on now!

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.240
Girodelle.

00:11:11.240 --> 00:11:11.640
Yes?

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:12.280
Who is that man?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.510
Ah, he's the new recruit,
Captain Nicolas de la Motte.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.740
I hear he enlisted through Cardinal Rohan's recommendation.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:25.820
What? You were able to meet Lady Antoinette?!

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:30.390
Yes, it was arranged through Oscar François,
so it wasn't a formal audience,

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:32.920
but I was able to have a friendly
conversation with Her Majesty.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.290
And so? When did she say she would see me?

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.060
Asking that so soon would have been...

00:11:37.060 --> 00:11:40.430
Oh, yes, Cardinal Rohan, would you like to write her a letter?

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:42.170
I'll deliver it myself.

00:11:42.170 --> 00:11:43.430
A letter?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.270
That's right! I didn't even think of that!

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:47.060
Let's do that! I'll write it!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.840
What do you think, Lady Jeanne?

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:54.550
Good work!

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.730
Anyone would assume that it's the
handwriting of a beautiful woman.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:00.440
My hard work has paid off then.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.150
You always do such fine work.

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:05.720
I'm always at your service,
if you should need anything.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.090
I, Rétaux, would do anything
for you, Lady Jeanne.

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:14.860
Dear, dear...

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:18.100
A-A reply?!

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:20.090
She wrote me a reply?!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.800
I told you to leave everything to me, didn't I?

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.810
It truly is an envelope with the royal
household's crest, the Fleur-de-lis!

00:12:34.820 --> 00:12:40.050
''D-Dear Cardinal Rohan, please forgive me
for my misconception of you until now.''

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:44.730
''Additionally, I wish to continue
our secret exchange.''

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:47.800
''Your loyalty will never be forgotten.''

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.830
Ah, and this glorious and elegant signature!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.250
Signed, ''Marie Antoinette de France.''

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.630
This is the greatest happiness of my life!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:59.170
By the way, Cardinal...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:01.130
What is it?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:09.100
The Queen has asked if you could donate about
50,000 livres, as proof of your loyalty.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.060
Of course I will!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.060
50,000 livres is a small favor.

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:18.300
Speaking of which, I must reward
you for your assistance, Jeanne.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:21.690
My, how gracious of you, Cardinal Rohan.

00:13:23.900 --> 00:13:26.000
Good Lord! 50,000 livres!

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.370
We can just live it up for the
next 10 years with this, Jeanne!

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.140
Hmph! You have such cheap aspirations!

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:32.140
We're just getting started!

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.250
As long as we use the Queen's name,
we can take him for all he's worth!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:38.720
Hey, take it easy. That's vodka.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.340
Drinking it like that can't be good for you.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.950
Thanks, but leave me.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:43.920
Just let me be!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.680
What an interesting world we live in...

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:49.890
Yeah, right.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.430
How is it so interesting?

00:13:51.430 --> 00:13:52.330
Shut up!

00:13:56.630 --> 00:14:01.110
It has to be interesting... It has to...

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:03.700
What the... You're crying?

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.330
My, how unusual.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:19.890
It's Cardinal Rohan.

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.920
What could he be thinking,
coming to a ball hosted by Her Majesty?

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.200
Truly.

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.530
Her Majesty hates him so much
she refuses to even speak to him.

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.800
My, is that true?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.840
Oh, you didn't know?

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:34.630
It all started with Her Majesty's mother.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:38.310
Remember how Cardinal Rohan was
once the ambassador to Austria?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.850
During his stay, all he did was frolic with
women, even though he's a man of the cloth.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:45.050
Queen Maria Theresa is a
deeply religious person,

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:47.850
so she disliked Cardinal Rohan greatly.

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:51.490
Her Majesty was directly influenced by her
Mother, so hence her distaste for him.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.690
Then, both mother and daughter dislike him?

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.950
Yes, and very blatantly, too.

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:11.530
Colonel, thank you for your assistance.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:12.840
Huh?

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.050
See you.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:19.770
What's the Cardinal talking about?

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.320
Her Majesty will make her entrance momentarily.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:39.440
I'm returning to my quarters!

00:15:39.440 --> 00:15:40.930
I'm feeling unwell today!

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:42.510
Your Majesty!

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.510
My Queen!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.800
What is the meaning of this?

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.260
What is the meaning of this?!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:56.720
What is the meaning of this?!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:01.660
Lady Jeanne, did you really give my
money and letters to Her Majesty?!

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:06.730
If you did, she wouldn't have treated
me like some worm, as she did!

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.600
She would have at least...
at least, given me a smile!

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.640
She wrote ''secret'' in her letters, didn't she?

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.570
The Queen's reply specifically said,
''a secret exchange.''

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:19.840
Please calm yourself, Cardinal Rohan.

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.680
Everything is in secret.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.670
If she suddenly acted friendly towards you,
imagine the attention it would attract.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.350
Also, if the Queen shows even the slightest bit
of kindness towards a gentleman nowadays,

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:32.170
the rumors begin to swirl instantly.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:36.180
At any rate, you should continue to
write her and send her more gifts.

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.790
That's the best thing.

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:44.560
I'll ask a friend who resides at the
palace to look into it and check.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.110
Please do so, to your heart's content.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:54.070
I have no intention of throwing
my money away into the sewer!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.910
Yes, that's why I said please do so.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:03.340
However, if you trust me, you'll be able to
see the Queen alone, just the two of you.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.040
What?

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:09.510
In 4 weeks, late at night, at the Grove
of Venus in the Gardens of Versailles.

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:15.720
The Queen has said she would meet you
and entrusted me to arrange the date.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.470
Is that true, Jeanne?! I mean, Lady Jeanne.

00:17:19.770 --> 00:17:22.190
Yes, Cardinal Rohan.

00:17:23.970 --> 00:17:25.210
Jeanne.

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.280
What were you thinking when you said
you'll arrange a meeting with the Queen?

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.310
Shut up and follow me!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:32.980
I'll introduce you my Queen in a moment.

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:34.640
''My Queen''...?

00:17:40.760 --> 00:17:41.930
Hey, what's going on?

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:43.120
This is a brothel.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.080
Yes, please come in.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.740
Welcome.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:55.730
Please enjoy your stay.

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:59.040
Only 10 sous for the night.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.470
Payment must be made upfront.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:03.020
Amazing! She looks exactly like the Queen!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:06.020
<i>The poor girl. She's blind.</i>

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.980
<i>But besides that, she's the spitting
image of the Queen!</i>

00:18:08.590 --> 00:18:10.550
Only 10 sous for the night.

00:18:10.550 --> 00:18:11.990
Payment must be made upfront.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.970
Master Rohan, please change your clothes soon.

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:23.400
I see. It's almost time?

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.580
Very well, very well.

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.500
Understand? Just one sentence.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.500
''You know how I feel, don't you?''
is all you have to say.

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.840
And then, hand him this rose.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:36.920
You know how I feel, don't you?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.220
Yes, just like that.

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:42.910
That's all you have to do and you'll be
paid over 10 years worth of your pay!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.640
The carriage is ready.

00:18:55.970 --> 00:18:57.990
André, head back without me today.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.070
After the cabinet meeting tomorrow,

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:03.580
His Majesty will take a walk in
the gardens with his ministers.

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:06.580
I need to check the route just in case.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.510
You're going alone?

00:19:07.510 --> 00:19:08.280
I'll go with you.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.590
No, it's simple enough. I can do it myself.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:19.020
Um, the Grove of Venus should be around here...

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:19.970
Welcome.

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.450
She's been awaiting you.

00:19:37.070 --> 00:19:38.170
Your Majesty!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:42.480
You've come here in the middle of the night,

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:44.670
solely to grace me with your splendid presence?!

00:19:47.250 --> 00:19:49.540
You know how I feel, don't you?

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:50.540
Yes!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.720
Heavens, a rose! For me!

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.630
I, Rohan, feel as though I am hogging
all the happiness in this world!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.730
You know how I feel, don't you?

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.170
Of course, Your Majesty!

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:07.370
Your Majesty!

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:09.410
Your Majesty! I, Rohan...

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.600
Cardinal Rohan!

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:12.340
It's an emergency!

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:13.560
Someone is coming!

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.010
That's not good!

00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:16.380
Please leave here at once!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.370
R-Right!

00:20:18.680 --> 00:20:21.090
Your Majesty! Until we meet again!

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.190
P-Please excuse me!

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:23.530
So long! So long...

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:25.620
Ouch!

00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:34.470
Jeanne! Watch it!

00:20:34.470 --> 00:20:35.420
Someone's really coming!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.630
Shoot, it's the commander!

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:58.690
It's a dead-end!

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.290
W-What do we do, Jeanne?!

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:05.420
If she sees this imposter Queen, we're done for!

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:09.030
Pull yourself together and act like a man.

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:16.370
Take her with you and get out of here.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.970
I'll handle the rest.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:49.910
I heard some splashing in the canal just now.

00:21:50.970 --> 00:21:52.280
I didn't notice.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:54.900
Perhaps it was a fish leaping in the water.

00:21:56.010 --> 00:21:59.880
What are you doing here at this late hour?

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:03.550
A lonely walk in the garden, that's all.

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:12.560
Well then, until next time. Please excuse me...

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:16.600
Lady Oscar François de Jarjayes...

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:33.410
